  {
   "slug": "courses",
   "title": "Courses",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our courses run in three terms: autumn, spring and summer. Most meet once a week for eight to twelve weeks; online courses can be started at any time.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"cc-courses\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide cc-courses\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Introduction to Botany</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Plants, soil and the science of growing things.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"cc-meta\"} --><p class=\"cc-meta\">Thursdays · 10 weeks · On campus</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conversational Portuguese</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Real conversations from the very first class.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"cc-meta\"} --><p class=\"cc-meta\">Tue & Thu evenings · Online</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Watercolour Foundations</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Washes, colour mixing and painting outdoors.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"cc-meta\"} --><p class=\"cc-meta\">Saturdays · 8 weeks · Studio</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Data Skills for Everyday Life</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Spreadsheets, charts and clear thinking.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"cc-meta\"} --><p class=\"cc-meta\">Self-paced · Online</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">By subject</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:table --><figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Subject</th><th>Courses</th><th>Levels</th><th>Where</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Languages</td><td>Spanish, Portuguese, Italian, German, Japanese</td><td>Beginner to advanced</td><td>Campus & online</td></tr><tr><td>Sciences</td><td>Botany, astronomy, everyday chemistry</td><td>Introductory</td><td>Campus</td></tr><tr><td>Arts & making</td><td>Watercolour, pottery, woodwork, photography</td><td>All levels</td><td>Studio & workshop</td></tr><tr><td>Practical skills</td><td>Data skills, bookkeeping, first aid</td><td>Introductory</td><td>Online</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table --><!-- wp:details --><details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Do I need any qualifications?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>No. Most courses are open to everyone; advanced language levels ask for a short placement chat.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></details><!-- /wp:details --><!-- wp:details --><details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Can I get a certificate?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Yes, every course includes a certificate of completion, and some lead to recognised qualifications.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></details><!-- /wp:details -->",
   "template": "",
   "featured_media": "library"
  },
  {
   "slug": "events",
   "title": "Events",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Talks, open evenings, exhibitions and festivals: everyone is welcome at the Commons.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:table --><figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Event</th><th>Where</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>14 November</td><td>Open evening and taster classes</td><td>Main hall</td></tr><tr><td>28 November</td><td>Winter science lecture: the night sky</td><td>Lecture theatre</td></tr><tr><td>6 December</td><td>Student art exhibition opens</td><td>Library gallery</td></tr><tr><td>12 December</td><td>Winter concert</td><td>Main hall</td></tr><tr><td>20 January</td><td>Spring term begins</td><td>Everywhere</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Events are free unless marked otherwise. Follow the news page for updates and new dates.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "template": "",
   "featured_media": "campus"
  },
  {
   "slug": "faculty",
   "title": "Faculty",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our teachers are scientists, artists, linguists and makers who love sharing what they know.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"cc-faculty\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide cc-faculty\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:teacher-1}}\" alt=\"Abstract portrait illustration of Hana Brightwater\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hana Brightwater</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Botany & Biology</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:teacher-2}}\" alt=\"Abstract portrait illustration of Tomas Ferreira\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tomas Ferreira</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Languages</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:teacher-3}}\" alt=\"Abstract portrait illustration of Robin Ashby\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Robin Ashby</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Woodwork & Design</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:teacher-4}}\" alt=\"Abstract portrait illustration of Grace Okonjo\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Grace Okonjo</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mathematics</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Office hours</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every teacher holds a weekly drop-in hour. Ask at the front office for the timetable.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "template": "",
   "featured_media": "faculty"
  },
  {
   "slug": "admissions",
   "title": "Admissions",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Joining the Commons is simple. There are no entrance exams for most courses, and our admissions team is happy to help you choose.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Choose a course from the course guide.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Apply online or at the front office.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Pay your fee, or ask about concessions and instalments.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Receive your welcome pack and timetable.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:apply}}\">Apply now</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons -->",
   "template": "",
   "featured_media": "study"
  },
  {
   "slug": "apply",
   "title": "Apply",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Applications for the spring term close on 15 January. It takes about ten minutes.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Your contact details</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>The courses you would like to take</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Any access needs we should know about</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>This is demo content: connect your own application form here, or link to your student information system.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "template": "",
   "parent": "admissions"
  },
  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The Commons opened in 1974 in a former railway office, with six courses and a borrowed piano. Today we welcome 1,800 students a year, aged sixteen to ninety-one.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Learning is for everyone, at every age, for its own sake.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Our founding charter</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Open to all</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>No entrance exams for most courses and concessions for anyone who needs them.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Small classes</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Never more than eighteen students, so everyone is heard.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Taught with joy</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Teachers who are still curious about their own subjects.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->",
   "template": "",
   "featured_media": "campus"
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Contact",
   "content": "<!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Front office</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Monday–Friday, 8:30–19:00<br>(555) 014-1974<br>office@campuscommons.example</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Find us</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>1 Station Square, Alder Hill<br>Five minutes' walk from the station; bike racks by the library.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->",
   "template": ""
  }
 ],
 "posts": [
  {
   "slug": "spring-term-enrolment-is-open",
   "title": "Spring Term Enrolment Is Open",
   "date": "2026-10-10T09:00:00",
   "excerpt": "Forty-two courses, eleven of them new, start in January. Here is what is on offer and how to secure your place before the 15th.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Enrolment for the spring term is now open. We are offering forty-two courses across languages, sciences, arts and practical skills, with eleven brand-new options designed with this year's students.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">New this spring</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Introduction to Botany</strong>: Thursdays, in the glasshouse.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Conversational Portuguese</strong>: online, two evenings a week.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Woodwork for Beginners</strong>: Saturday mornings in the workshop.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><strong>Data Skills for Everyday Life</strong>: spreadsheets without fear.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to enrol</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Choose your courses in the course guide.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Complete the short online form or visit the front office.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Pay in full or choose three monthly instalments.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Concessions are available for students, carers and anyone receiving income support. Ask us — it is a quick, private conversation.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:courses}}\">See all courses</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Popular courses fill quickly, so we recommend enrolling early. If a course is full, join the waiting list: places often open up in the first week.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "news",
    "courses"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "enrolment",
    "spring-term"
   ],
